{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测WindowsWerFault拉起可疑子进程。对应需求：防御规避。官方：Suspicious WerFault Child Process。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具"],"from":"now-9m","index":["winlogbeat-*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","endgame-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-m365_defender.event-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】WindowsWerFault拉起可疑子进程","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindowsWerFault拉起可疑子进程\n\n### 为何重要\n绕过防护、伪装或擦痕\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程、用户与事件ID。\n2. 核对路径、注册表、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与凭据操作。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件与账号。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","references":["https://www.hexacorn.com/blog/2019/09/19/silentprocessexit-quick-look-under-the-hood/","https://www.hexacorn.com/blog/2019/09/20/werfault-command-line-switches-v0-1/","https://github.com/sbousseaden/EVTX-ATTACK-SAMPLES/blob/master/Persistence/persistence_SilentProcessExit_ImageHijack_sysmon_13_1.evtx","http://web.archive.org/web/20230530011556/https://blog.menasec.net/2021/01/"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"ac5012b8-8da8-440b-aaaf-aedafdea2dff","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 防御规避","来源: 默认","对应需求: 防御规避"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and\n\n  process.parent.name : \"WerFault.exe\" and\n\n  /* args -s and -t used to execute a process via SilentProcessExit mechanism */\n  (process.parent.args : \"-s\" and process.parent.args : \"-t\" and process.parent.args : \"-c\") and\n\n  not process.executable : (\"?:\\\\Windows\\\\SysWOW64\\\\Initcrypt.exe\", \"?:\\\\Program Files (x86)\\\\Heimdal\\\\Heimdal.Guard.exe\")\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1036","name":"Masquerading","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1036/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1546","name":"Event Triggered Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1546/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1546.012","name":"Image File Execution Options Injection","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1546/012/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1546","name":"Event Triggered Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1546/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1546.012","name":"Image File Execution Options Injection","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1546/012/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0004","name":"Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0004/"}}],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","message"]},"version":421,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
